### Page 1 of 19

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

August 6, 2024
SUBJECT:
Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Lotus
Engineering & Sustainability, LLC, for the Comprehensive Climate Action Plan
(CCAP) Preparation For Cheyenne, Wyoming
 ______________________________________________
Four (4) Proposers responded to Request for Proposal (RFP) #13-24, for the Comprehensive
Climate Action Plan (CCAP) Preparation For Cheyenne, Wyoming, Project.

The proposals were received from:
1. Lotus Engineering & Sustainability, LLC
2. Constellation
3. Blue Strike Environmental
4. Sustainability Solutions

Upon review of the proposals by the evaluation panel, and subsequent interviews, the group has
recommended acceptance of the proposal submitted by Lotus Engineering & Sustainability, LLC,
for a project award amount of $299,985.00

Basis for award was based on a Qualifications and Cost based review and scoring of proposals.

Funding:
025-21-2111-40-46509
(EPA Climate Pollution Reduction Grant (CPRG), Planning Grant)
```

